    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "funnel",
      "text": "Three parallel readouts apply the spiral flag and two frozen thresholds; exact counts stay attached to their branches.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "raw_file": "audio_v3/raw/s13-1a27c2ca9817.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "4cc05f5bd7fc134c6d73bf213190dffba1f29d40afb188f4cb45940dd1d20f0b",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v3/decoded/s13.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "2f0f283baeb0047e23b58b8dda912de85b1b7ba3ca13c2936e41ed50cac62e21",
      "audio_start_sample": 4576963,
      "audio_end_sample": 4886851,
      "audio_start_seconds": 95.35339583333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 101.80939583333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 2861,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 95.36666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.013270833333322685,
      "pause_after_samples": 177075,
      "pause_after_seconds": 3.6890625
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "Within one readout, N C W and N A C W count the labels.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "raw_file": "audio_v3/raw/s14-fedecb328ae8.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "7497ab6c17618e29f9bf67c36dc8260607f07f23059a116583afafc866c3800f",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v3/decoded/s14.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "f5b7ada23a04810c8777b73fd001ee702444c56df0f154f66bc7b375975ac5ac",
      "audio_start_sample": 5063926,
      "audio_end_sample": 5353078,
      "audio_start_seconds": 105.49845833333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 111.52245833333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3165,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 105.5,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.0015416666666681067,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "Their difference is the numerator, and their total is the denominator.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "raw_file": "audio_v3/raw/s15-b20390383d0f.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "49e191b3ab585f2f3f111c2a55a7b637c39f802653ede7d2405420f940b9e58a",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v3/decoded/s15.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "3c27ab966164398291c388a6d146f5362ec11282ba2b91227043e0d06068f2c8",
      "audio_start_sample": 5389078,
      "audio_end_sample": 5560726,
      "audio_start_seconds": 112.27245833333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 115.84845833333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 3368,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 112.26666666666667,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0057916666666670835,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "The sign would indicate which label is more numerous, but the predeclared asymmetry value remains withheld.",
      "word_count": 16,
      "raw_file": "audio_v3/raw/s16-57707812688a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "0f6c6c284ee42a89c5f4bf2db58c7054249f1842427e033fa60470661fa7b8d7",
